dance Molten
// The bass pushes the morph; the bass brings it nearer; the middle sets how fast it spins and the
// kicks turn it; drops in the middle reverse it; drops in the bass switch its flat spin on and
// off.
// Inspired by mollux, a DancerDNA music style.

morph   follows music.bass  speed 2.46  settle 0.02
zoom    follows music.bass  amount 0.5  settle 1.81
spin    follows music.mid  from 275 to 11.5  smooth 0.25
turn    on music.bass_hit changes  by 0.53
reverse on music.mid drops  by 0.41  on 6 off 2
flat    on music.bass drops  by 0.7  on 64 off 64
